# Build basic todo list

## Goal

Replace the counter demo in `projects/basic-react` with a responsive two-pane todo interface backed by React state.

## Requirements

- Show todo items in a selectable list on the left.
- Show the selected todo's title, notes, and due date in an editable details panel on the right.
- Support adding, selecting, editing, completing, and deleting todos.
- Provide clear selected, completed, loading-free empty, and focus states.
- Stack the panels into a usable mobile layout.
- Keep the implementation typed and dependency-free.
- Extend the component tests to cover the complete todo workflow.

## Verification

Run the repository-bound commands:

```text
npm --prefix projects/basic-react run check
npm --prefix projects/basic-react run build
```

Do not merge or deploy. Publication requires confirmation bound to the exact pull-request preview.
